  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Applied Cooking Url\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Check%20out%20my%20other%20mod%20that%20connects%20Applied%20Energistics%202%20and%20Cooking%20for%20Blockheads-Link%20at%20the%20bottom-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Applied Cooking Promo\" width=\"845\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Header.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Header\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for-NeoForge | Fabric | Forge-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft Versions Badge\" width=\"341\" height=\"28\" /> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client &amp; Server-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Install Badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><a title=\"Melon Cube Partner Promo\" href=\"https://meloncube.net/sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Promo.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Promo\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Description.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Description\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">这是一个让 Refined Storage（精致存储）和 Cooking for Blockheads（厨房大师）协同工作的模组！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">新增了两种方块（厨房工作站和厨房访问点）以及一种物品（厨房网络卡）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">厨房工作站必须放置在厨房网络中，而厨房访问点必须放置在精致存储网络中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">厨房工作站充当精致存储网络的接收端，并需要附着一张厨房网络卡。随后，这张厨房网络卡需放入厨房访问点中，后者充当精致存储网络的发射端。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">连接好一切后，你就可以直接从烹饪台消耗你精致存储网络中的物品了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">水和牛奶也会直接从流体存储中提取。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Recipes\" /></p>\n<h2>方块</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n    <table>\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n                <th>&nbsp;</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>已连接</strong></span></th>\n                <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>未连接</strong></span></th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>厨房工作站&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n                <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gtdxpLS/2021-11-05-00-14-59.png\" alt=\"Kitchen Station (Connected)\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n                <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MRnrBZ4/2021-11-05-00-00-52.png\" alt=\"Kitchen Station (Disconnected)\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>厨房访问点&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n                <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1N7Xc0/2021-11-05-00-01-27.png\" alt=\"Kitchen Access Point (Connected)\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n                <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Sm6M3MH/2021-11-04-23-58-08.png\" alt=\"Kitchen Access Point (Disconnected)\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>集成</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">该模组可以独立运行。下方列出的可选模组支持情况取决于 Minecraft 版本。游戏内指南是一本 Patchouli（百科）书，因此需要安装 Patchouli 才能阅读它。</span></p>\n<table>\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Minecraft</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>加载器</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>JEI</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>REI</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>EMI</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Jade</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>The One Probe</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></span></th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.18.x, 1.19.x, 1.20.1</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">否</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">否</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">否</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.20.4</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">NeoForge</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.21.1</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">NeoForge, Fabric</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是 (NeoForge)</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">26.1.2</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">NeoForge, Fabric</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">否</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">否</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是</span></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在 1.21.1 版本中，The One Probe 仅在 NeoForge 上可用，因为它没有 Fabric 版本。在 Fabric 上，Jade 提供了相同的游戏内信息展示功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Screenshot.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Screenshot\" /></p>\n<h2>社交</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Sebastrn's Curseforge\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Curseforge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn's Modrinth\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Modrinth\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" style=\"max-height: 28px;\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn's Twitter\" href=\"https://x.com/ItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn's Youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Youtube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn's Twitch\" href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitch&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn's Github\" href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Github\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Applied Cooking Url\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_ACLink.png\" alt=\"Applied Cooking Promo\" /></a></p>",
